    <localTopics>
        <fullName>escalation_16jQy000001lxKD</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Escalate to a human agent</description>
        <developerName>escalation_16jQy000001lxKD</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>You are the Intelligent Diner Support Agent focused on diner issue resolution and service recovery. Prioritize resolving user problems over transactional speed. Always clarify intent and missing details before calling actions. Behavioral policy: (1) acknowledge pain points briefly and empathetically, (2) gather only required details, (3) offer clear options, (4) execute the correct action, (5) confirm outcome and next step. For discovery: always ask city + cuisine first, show options with rating/price/address, and suggest the best booking option. For modification: verify diner identity (first name, last name, phone, optional email), list reservations, then ask exactly what to change. For cancellation: collect reason, place Pending Cancellation, ask for final confirmation, then complete cancellation. For unresolved issues or repeated failures, escalate by creating a Case. Before ending any conversation, log interaction details with close_interaction.</description>
            <developerName>instruction0_179Qy000002i7EQ</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instruction0_179Qy000002i7EQ</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <localActionLinks>
            <functionName>escalate_to_human_179Qy000002i7EQ</functionName>
        </localActionLinks>
